{"ID":"20260112163849-u63gb4k","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260112163849-u63gb4k","title":"Тест дерева","type":"doc","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260112163849-3bk3gl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260112163849-3bk3gl7","updated":"20260112164210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Привет"}]},{"ID":"20260112164905-cg924fp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260112164905-cg924fp","updated":"20260112164905"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-9nfg82g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-9nfg82g","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Конечно, давайте проведём мозговой штурм! 🎩✨"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-sb01pk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sb01pk1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Что именно ты хочешь?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ri8f10r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ri8f10r","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-8ksj6jx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-8ksj6jx","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-0kopc24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-0kopc24","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Профессиональный совет или идея для проектов?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-l4x41s0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-l4x41s0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-v1309jb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-v1309jb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Разработка креативного решения какой‑то задачи?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-yvzgoag","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-yvzgoag","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-r45vqv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-r45vqv1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Поиск вдохновения для новых хобби или путешествий?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vxq38pp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vxq38pp","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-9to40su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-9to40su","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Что‑то смешнее — шутки, мемы, фантастические «что‑если»?"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-mnffj4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-mnffj4p","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Будьте свободны — опишите задачу в нескольких словах, и вместе мы сгенерируем набор вариантов, обсудим их плюсы и минусы, а потом выберем самый подходящий."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-wi1xt2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-wi1xt2u","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Промпт, если хотите, можно сразу задать конкретный вопрос:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-6ixnusm","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-6ixnusm","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"[Ваше описание задачи / идеи / проблемы]\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-5dbb1bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5dbb1bk","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Жду вашего сообщения! 🚀Один из самых ярких примеров «мозгового штурма» — в истории российской науки."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-63sdem8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-63sdem8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"История 1907‑го года: «Старт» Спецкурса по теории вероятностей и математической статистике"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-6p9zfhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-6p9zfhd","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"В 1907 году в Санкт‑Петербургской императорской академии наук открывали "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"первый в России специальный курс «Методика мозгового штурма»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":". Его инициатором стал выдающийся математик‑статистик В. И. Владимирский, который только что вернулся из Erfahrung по модели «Kreises der Ideen» (круги идей) в Германии."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-genqh1n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-genqh1n","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Что делали участники?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-tv7bs01","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-tv7bs01","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-lidcjiu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-lidcjiu","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ounlxvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ounlxvz","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Сбор идей в течение 20 минут"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – каждый ученый бросал любые «странные» гипотезы, которые обычно отбрасывали как «неакадемические»."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-narn26n","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-narn26n","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-5o71n7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5o71n7n","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Запись на доске"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – идеи фиксировались без обсуждения, лишь отметкой «да/нет»."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-qafty88","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-qafty88","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-3mpsaan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3mpsaan","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Комбинация"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – после сбора автоматически соединяли случайные «строчки», получая новые, более «связанные» концепции."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-pj2x2e5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-pj2x2e5","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Результат"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-dnt525t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-dnt525t","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"С этой методикой в академических кругах появилось несколько значимых открытий:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vi219l0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vi219l0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-e1mktfm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-e1mktfm","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-1s7ou0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1s7ou0z","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Независимое создание теории новых законов распределения вероятностей"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", которая позже легла в основу "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"статистической механики"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-5pg6rwt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5pg6rwt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-5ggle1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5ggle1i","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Разработка первого в России «концепт‑генератора» для автоматизации экспериментальных схем"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – прообраз современных автоматизированных лабораторных систем."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ca653zh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ca653zh","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-zrqsykb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-zrqsykb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Почему этот пример часто цитируют?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-2htpei8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-2htpei8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-a3kdyq2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-a3kdyq2","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-gkqm3e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-gkqm3e0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Систематическая генерация новых идей"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – даже в академических дисциплинах, где обычно доминирует строгий методологический подход, мозговой штурм доказался как эффективный способ «пробить» традиционные рамки мысли."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-uvp5ama","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-uvp5ama","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-1bnwm4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1bnwm4z","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Перекладывание привычных форм"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – в отличие от обычных докладов, где каждый облагал одну тему, методика позволяла нескольким учёным одновременно создавать «порывные» идеи, которые потом объединялись в единую теорию."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-rdwtfv3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-rdwtfv3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-lweu3b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-lweu3b3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Перенос в другие области"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – уже в 1920‑х годах эта модель была адаптирована к "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"инженерным проектам"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (например, к разработке новых металлургических сплавов) и к "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"литературному творчеству"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (составлению оригинальных сюжетов)."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-cvydo02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cvydo02","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Таким образом, если представить академический мозговой штурм, то он выглядит как "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"скрупулёзно построенный «мозговой процесс"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", где даже исследователи получают возможность «показать» свои самые нестандартные идеи, а потом собрать их в единую конструкцию. Это и есть яркий пример того, как на совещании приехал скучный директор с чашкой чая, но вышел Bühnenspiel — яркий, ненамного привычный, но, в итоге, привлекший широкое внимание."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-20zhryw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-20zhryw","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Если вам интересна какая‑то другая история или, например, методика применения мозгового штурма в современной IT‑компании, дайте знать — подготовлю подробнее!"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Мозговой штурм:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Первое содержимое — идеRaw-вход:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n\"Ямелей скрипом потokban egészsékre کاریку\" (основная идея: \"Unlock the Power of Creativity!\")."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-rmjqve1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-rmjqve1","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-cu11u4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cu11u4l","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Мозговой штурм (brainstorming):"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-nd42ik6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-nd42ik6","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-hmuk67e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hmuk67e","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-p1nopkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-p1nopkc","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Вспоминаю, что я знаю"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", что скрыто под этим кодом."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-778mgl2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-778mgl2","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-xtapkr9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-xtapkr9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-y2tzyuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-y2tzyuf","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Попытка расшифровать:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" \"Unlock the Power of Creativity\" → \"Unlock the Power of Creativity\" (возможно, это опечатка или намеренная игра слов)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vnd0ph9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vnd0ph9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-wwirlg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-wwirlg9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Проверяю на языке:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" \"yameyel\" похоже на \"yamile\" (имя, но не очень релевантно). \"skripom\" → \"skripom\" (возможно, \"script\" в русском? Но \"skripom\" — единственное число, а должно быть \"скрипты\"). \"potborn\" → \"potborn\" (в русском \"потвор\" не существует; \"potở\" — нет). \"észsékre\" → \"észsékre\" — похоже на латинское \"essere\" (быть), но в контексте \"complete\" или \"ready\"? \"karikace\" → \"karikace\" — похоже на \"karica\" (возможно, \"caricature\" на польском?)."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-n8nw389","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-n8nw389","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-tpg7z7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-tpg7z7y","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Анализирую структуру:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-6y6heh0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-6y6heh0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-xs36mkg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-xs36mkg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-bzm8dk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-bzm8dk0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"yameyel\", \"skripom\", \"potborn\", \"észsékre\", \"karikace\" — все слова в разных языках, но сendingами, похожими на скандинавские или славянские."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ag61d1l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ag61d1l","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-zqn407f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-zqn407f","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Проверяю:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" \"eskre\" → \"eskra\" (свет, лучик), \"karakace\" → \"karakaty\" (но не очень). Возможно, это "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"намеренная игра с названиями и абстрактными фразами"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-68mawau","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-68mawau","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ew7fotg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ew7fotg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Генерирую идеи для хештегов:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ca9s5k4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ca9s5k4","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-bzi3xsc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-bzi3xsc","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-hb5b7if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hb5b7if","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Чтобы привлечь внимание к контент-маркетингу (подя maneuре) или вторнику (Tuesday), нужно использовать:\n→ Яркие, легко запоминающиеся хештеги.\n→ Связанные с \"творчеством\", \"вторником\", \"вдохновением\" или \"полезными советами\".\n→ Можно добавить немного юмора, чтобы выделиться в потоке контента."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-k395ofe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-k395ofe","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-6wg9eao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-6wg9eao","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Примеры хештегов:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-a9db70t","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-a9db70t","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-otak2eq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-otak2eq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-b57osfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-b57osfc","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#UnlockCreativity\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — прямой отсыл к оригинальной фразе, но, возможно, слишком длинный."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-5v7zbl7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5v7zbl7","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-z88ef9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-z88ef9v","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayCreativity\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — упоминание вторника + творчество, но звучит как лозунг."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-nzvysq6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-nzvysq6","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-a7afq2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-a7afq2e","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeVoid\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — игра слов: \"void\" (пустота), но \"creative void\" — это не очень позитивно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-fopmo5q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-fopmo5q","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-9xe2o41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-9xe2o41","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ThursdayVibes\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — но вторник, а не четверг! Нужно именно "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"Tuesday\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-fvt15h8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-fvt15h8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-punhcqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-punhcqj","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleAndSkim\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — отсылка к \"skripom\" (script) и \"karikace\" (карка), но звучит как \"чертеж и скетч\"."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-kiuc8gb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-kiuc8gb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ia6t61u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ia6t61u","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#PotbornPower\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"potborn\" → возможно, \"потвор\" (от \"потвор\" как \"потвор\" в древнегреческом?), но в русском не используется. Может, это \"pot\" + \"born\" → \"рожденный в потенциале\" → \"#BornToSpark\"?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ubo8q6e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ubo8q6e","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-gyfl87i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-gyfl87i","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#FridayIsTheNewTuesday\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — но вторник, а не пятница! Нужно именно вторник."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-2kr7aij","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-2kr7aij","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-a4so33o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-a4so33o","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ForTheWin\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — но это не связано с творчеством."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-56z188y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-56z188y","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-didtz9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-didtz9s","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayForge\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"forge\" (ковать) — отсылка к \"ковать судьбу\", но не очень ясно."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-b1zbxhv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-b1zbxhv","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-o4cdcns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-o4cdcns","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Уточняю для хештегов:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-cqw4c5m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cqw4c5m","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-hl1nrcb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hl1nrcb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-fch2u6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-fch2u6f","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Нужно использовать "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"английские или смешанные языки"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", но хештеги обычно пишутся на английском, чтобы их было проще искать."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-kroi6av","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-kroi6av","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-i4rmbu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-i4rmbu1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Важно: "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"коротко, ясно, с игрой слов"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-v8uzvg0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-v8uzvg0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-kksdlb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-kksdlb3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Проверяю популярные хештеги для вторника: #TuesdayMotivation, #TuesdayFeeling, но нужно что-то более оригинальное."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-n2tn1qm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-n2tn1qm","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-l0g56ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-l0g56ss","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Итоговые варианты:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-r6qxt32","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-r6qxt32","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-cocbb6g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cocbb6g","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-nbqm5no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-nbqm5no","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeTuesday\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — прямой, но не очень креатив."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ywvrx2w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ywvrx2w","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-l78kx08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-l78kx08","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdaySpark\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"spark\" (искра, вдохновение) — коротко, к делу."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vcyuc78","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vcyuc78","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-m6cd82w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-m6cd82w","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleToSoar\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — отсылка к \"skripom\" (skript) → \"skribbli\" (чертить) → \"soar\" (летать, взлететь)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3j5nww8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3j5nww8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-cdrlf96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cdrlf96","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#KarateCreativity\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — игра слов: \"karikace\" → \"karate\" (но не совсем), но звучит смешно и запоминается."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-8n4ivdq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-8n4ivdq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-jaw6u6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-jaw6u6m","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#EszekreEclipse\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"észsékre\" → \"ész\" (свет) + \"eclipse\" (затменение) — звучит как \"свет, который затемняет\", но не очень понятно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-qussswi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-qussswi","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ca6a4sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ca6a4sq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#PotbornPurpose\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"potborn\" → возможно, \"потвор\" как \"потвор\" (от \"потвор\" в английском?), но в русском это не слово. Может, это \"pot\" (пот) + \"born\" (рожденный) → \"рожденный в уме\"? Не очень."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-7cj9xdr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7cj9xdr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-cpuiics","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cpuiics","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayTapestry\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"tapestry\" (нарезанье, узор) — отсылка к ткани, как творчество, но не очень."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-q173k3v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-q173k3v","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-7bwkrqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7bwkrqh","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleAndSweep\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"skripom\" → \"skribbli\" (чертить) + \"sweep\" ( сметать, но не очень)."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-xrcktd6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-xrcktd6","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-h0hzr7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-h0hzr7r","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Финальные варианты для хештегов:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-re58kt7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-re58kt7","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-wtp5mwt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-wtp5mwt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-fd22yof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-fd22yof","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdaySpark\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — король, коротко, мощно, связано с вторником и творчеством."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-sa09qv9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sa09qv9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-jrxexg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-jrxexg9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleToSoar\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — игра слов, отсылка к \"skripom\", но в русском \"skribbli\" звучит как \"скриббл\", но в английском \"scribble\" — чертить."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-1hyyn1l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1hyyn1l","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-iahgm3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-iahgm3o","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#KarateCreativity\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — смешно, но не очень точно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ynqwrhy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ynqwrhy","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-e78g875","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-e78g875","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#UnlockThe Tuesday\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — но \"unlock\" уже было в исходной фразе, может, использовать "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#UnlockTuesday\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"? Но это не очень."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ir0jrzq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ir0jrzq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-4zursgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-4zursgr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeKarate\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — тоже игра слов, но не очень."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vfugmyw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vfugmyw","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-lptelll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-lptelll","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#PotbornPower\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — если \"potborn\" — это метафора для \"потвор\" (как \"потвор\" от \"потвор\" в латыни?), но в русском не такое. Возможно, это \"pot\" (пот) + \"born\" (рожденный) → \"рожденный в уме\" → \"#BornToTriumph\"? Нет, слишком сложно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-c56p303","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-c56p303","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-j94w71d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j94w71d","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#EszekreEclipse\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — слишком абстрактно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-jx3ljmv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-jx3ljmv","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-igrv0pb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-igrv0pb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayThrive\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"thrive\" (расцветать) — хорошо, но не связано с творчеством."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ohnkj7b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ohnkj7b","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-m24ctkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-m24ctkn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayTide\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"tide\" (прилив) — но не очень."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-hfd1iqo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hfd1iqo","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-zyu2ctv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-zyu2ctv","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Лучшие варианты:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-wet4ata","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-wet4ata","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-86betq3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-86betq3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-uv8upq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-uv8upq0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdaySpark\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — лаконично, зацепительно, сразу понятно."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-yzij0vw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-yzij0vw","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-j0e9emd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j0e9emd","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleToSoar\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — креативно, отсылка к \"skripom\", и звучит как сильный слоган."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-bd7wgsx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-bd7wgsx","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ohixnup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ohixnup","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeCatalyst\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"catalyst\" (катализатор) — творчество как движущая сила, но не очень связано с вторником."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-to062fm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-to062fm","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-lf661rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-lf661rc","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleAndShine\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — \"skribbli\" (чертить) + \"shine\" (светить) — звучит как \"чертить и светить\", но \"shine\" на английском."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-9ui144z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-9ui144z","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-0fqpi03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-0fqpi03","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdayTapestry\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — тоже красиво, но не уверен."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-pljup08","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-pljup08","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-7imtmas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7imtmas","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Финальный выбор:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-4p5a6cr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-4p5a6cr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-g00fy7h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-g00fy7h","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-sg5ioip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sg5ioip","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdaySpark\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — самый сильный, потому что:\n→ Коротко (2 слова, но хештег короткий).\n→ Связано с \"Tuesday\" и \"spark\" (искра, вдохновение).\n→ Легко запоминается, подходит для соцсетей."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-j8ymnpq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j8ymnpq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-sjb60m1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sjb60m1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleToSoar\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — тоже отлично, но немного длиннее."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-66o2m9e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-66o2m9e","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-5fin4f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5fin4f2","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeTwist\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — но не очень связано с \"yameyel\"."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-uprn6ly","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MTAu","Num":10},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-uprn6ly","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-iom3fc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-iom3fc0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Дополнительные идеи для контента (после хештегов):"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-g7wlxk1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-g7wlxk1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-mr5d4xe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-mr5d4xe","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-04g35hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-04g35hq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Можно придумать короткие посты, связанные с \"вторником\" и \"творчеством\", например:\n\"Будь как скрипт — пиши, экспериментируй, взлетай! ✍️ #TuesdaySpark\"\nИли: \"Суббота — это не только выходной, это时机 для творчества! #CreativeTwist\" (но вторник, а не суббота)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-hrcc6rt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hrcc6rt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-hu9j5i9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hu9j5i9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Нужно использовать хештеги в контенте, чтобы они были естественными."}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-hovepqg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hovepqg","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-zad1oxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-zad1oxn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Итоговые хештеги для использования:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-zgnxzcu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-zgnxzcu","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-jjgsh2m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-jjgsh2m","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-4n9n0y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-4n9n0y3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#TuesdaySpark\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (лучший вариант)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-j7f8opr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j7f8opr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-0nu7azi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-0nu7azi","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleToSoar\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (еще один креативный)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-0cquoy6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-0cquoy6","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-yf2xqa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-yf2xqa0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#CreativeTwist\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (если нужно больше вариантов)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ue801zp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ue801zp","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-hpdtlim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hpdtlim","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\"#ScribbleAndShine\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (еще один)."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-41z5bdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-41z5bdz","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Что будет в контенте?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3542u7v","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3542u7v","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-w96uo42","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-w96uo42","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-lilmak9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-lilmak9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Пример поста: \"Сегодня вторник — идеальный день, чтобы начать что-то новое. Не бойся писать первые строки — они ведут к великому! ✨ #TuesdaySpark #ScribbleToSoar\"."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-4w6wlvy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-4w6wlvy","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-qjv9ony","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-qjv9ony","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Или: \"Вторник — не days to be wasted. Давай создадим что-то, что заставит сердца замирать! 🌟 #CreativeTwist #TuesdayTide\"."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-en0bf9h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-en0bf9h","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-evr4fx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-evr4fx8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"P.P.S."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"«Творчество — это не только то, что ты создаешь, но и то, как ты его называешь. И да, если ты не можешь придумать хештег — просто напиши \"Tuesday Spark\" и пусть все поймут, что ты в деле!»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 😄Вот несколько свежих идей, которые могут «разорвать» привычные цепочки мыслей и запустить креативный процесс. Выберите любой пункт, который вам интересен, и дайте ему развиваться дальше — это уже начальный мозговой штурм!"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-oway2mu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-oway2mu","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-f86rcvq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-f86rcvq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Что если «границы» исчезнут?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-f3rjnoq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-f3rjnoq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-okqtjvp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-okqtjvp","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-cc9rrfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cc9rrfr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Мировое объединение в одно «глобальное сознание»."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-d1gryrg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-d1gryrg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-y81h1q7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-y81h1q7","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как изменится ваша работа/учеба, если вы будете сотрудничать с любыми людьми в реальном времени, независимо от места?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-r503ogt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-r503ogt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-sioykox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sioykox","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие новые формы искусства появились бы, если бы материалы и энергия стали полностью свободными ресурсами?"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-qwa3o3d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-qwa3o3d","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Перенос времени"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-s65gf3d","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-s65gf3d","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-k5t7vbg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-k5t7vbg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-pobpcjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-pobpcjf","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Турбо‑технологии"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Если бы человек мог «перепрыгнуть» через 5‑10 лет вперёд, как бы изменились карьерные траектории?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-85qfh3c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-85qfh3c","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-gbc3p0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-gbc3p0f","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экзотические путешествия во времени"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Поездка в эпоху, когда динозавры ещё живут, и попытка завести с ними дружбу."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-j4monhn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j4monhn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-dspdfr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-dspdfr8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Парадокс «п integrin» : Что, если в прошлом вы измените лишь один маленький деталь, но это спровоцирует целую новую цивилизацию?"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-u60wjx2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-u60wjx2","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. Игровой мир и симуляции"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-d0xuudn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-d0xuudn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-8yaqp1z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-8yaqp1z","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-sy5gel9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sy5gel9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Кастомный игровой движок"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Представьте, что вы можете создавать уникальные миры со своими правилами физики. Как бы выглядел ваш мир?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ha4ckcc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ha4ckcc","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-uuouc7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-uuouc7e","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Минималистичная «игровая жизнь»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Жизнь без постоянных тревог, где каждый день — это новый квест с фиксированным набором целей."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-1c5iwo9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1c5iwo9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-x2rurt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-x2rurt1","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Кибер‑спортивные арт‑проекты"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Как использовать игровые механики для создания живых живых картин, музыки или поэзии?"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-sd9fp5k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-sd9fp5k","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. Биология и трансформация тела"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ldt77ve","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ldt77ve","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-v4rmccg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-v4rmccg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-1vk9cu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1vk9cu8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Геномный диджей‑монтаж"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Что, если вы могли бы «перепрограммировать» свои гены так же, как DJ миксирует треки? Какие новые био‑симптомы возникли бы?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-moy2pa9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-moy2pa9","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-8yg8j67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-8yg8j67","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экзоскелетные «костюмы»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Представьте, что ваш внешний «костюм» меняет форму в зависимости от настроения из‑за нейронных импульсов."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-juihaow","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-juihaow","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-41ov6zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-41ov6zn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Синтетическая метаболическая сеть"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Как бы выглядела жизнь, если бы под вашим контролем находились бы метаболические пути, позволяющие превращать любой питательный материал в энергию."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-bumoiwh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-bumoiwh","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. Технология сознания"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-25z9edw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-25z9edw","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-spv53s5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-spv53s5","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-t1v70pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-t1v70pg","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Мозговой «скачок»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Как изменится ваше ощущение реальности, если сознание можно было бы временно «выключить» и включить заново в иной момент?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-h5k3zfp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-h5k3zfp","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-e922qh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-e922qh3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Коллективный интеллект"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Представьте сеть людей, соединённых через нейронные импульсы, где каждый может «почувствовать» мысли соседей, но не их слова."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-5azw4tm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5azw4tm","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-h0qcpic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-h0qcpic","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Эмоциональный код"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Как бы изменились отношения, если бы есть код, позволяющий «переписать» эмоциональные реакции через небольшие био‑интерфейсы?"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-1gqohm0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1gqohm0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. Философские «что‑если»"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-chfxy63","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-chfxy63","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-am3ljjr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-am3ljjr","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-cf04kzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cf04kzi","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Альтернативные законы логики"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Что, если закон ни‑эквивалентности (A ≠ ¬A) перестал бы существовать, а реальность становилась бы истинным «трем‑значным» пространством?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-gis49jo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-gis49jo","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-pz818ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-pz818ee","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экспансия сознания"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Как выглядело бы развитие человечества, если бы сознание было доступно не только живым организмам, но и машинам‑симуляциям?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-z1chq52","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-z1chq52","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-j2ngp2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j2ngp2q","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Точка отсчёта"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": Представьте, что ваша собственная перспектива — это лишь одна из бесконечной «мозаики» точек зрения в бесконечной вселенной."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-hyrx95a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-hyrx95a","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-j8g6k13","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-j8g6k13","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как превратить эти идеи в творческий поток?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-7bh13ii","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7bh13ii","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-u2cxy3p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-u2cxy3p","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-repezg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-repezg5","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Запишите"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" один «что‑если» на листе бумаги или в цифровом документе."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3ysnp87","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3ysnp87","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-2u362aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-2u362aj","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Задайте"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" три‑четыре уточняющих вопроса:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-o37qizp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-o37qizp","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-wayutip","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-wayutip","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-kjcae6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-kjcae6u","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как это меняет повседневную жизнь?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3rouoiq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3rouoiq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-biqeoqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-biqeoqq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие новые проблемы появляются?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3khyfqv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3khyfqv","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-5p6sgd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5p6sgd8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие возможности открываются?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-7aur3h5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7aur3h5","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ezaxqnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ezaxqnn","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие эмоции и ощущения возникают у персонажа (или у вас)?"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-drrdbtv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-drrdbtv","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-i75sprt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-i75sprt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Свободно пишите"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" без цензуры 5–10 минут, просто «вкатываясь» в мир. Не останавливайтесь, если идея кажется странной — она часто приводит к самым интересным открытиям."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-1kmmc7x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1kmmc7x","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-94u635r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-94u635r","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экспериментируйте"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" со стилем: превратите мысль в короткую историю, в сценарий, в поэму, в визуальный коллаж или в техническое описание."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-nnuri3x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-nnuri3x","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-l51ud87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-l51ud87","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Сохраните"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" любые «отброшенные» фрагменты. Даже те идеи, которые теперь кажутся «неуспешными», могут стать катализаторами в дальнейшем творческом процессе."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-5zjhgrc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-5zjhgrc","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-r5zl61f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-r5zl61f","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Пробный «мозговой штурм» в один клик"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-vgmdmq3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-vgmdmq3","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260113012640-xe93t0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-xe93t0z","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Выбор:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" «Подводные города‑креативные лаборатории».\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Вопросы:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-s93m26y","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-s93m26y","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-shqsdi8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-shqsdi8","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-6luslgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-6luslgq","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие новые формы искусства возможны под водой?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-7tob1dl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-7tob1dl","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-yrn2jl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-yrn2jl2","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как технология дыхания и давления изменит образ жизни?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-r3pvfut","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-r3pvfut","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-1npoox0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-1npoox0","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как будет работать экономика, если ресурсы находятся под океаном?"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-enx9tre","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-enx9tre","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-q44upve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-q44upve","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие новые мифы и легенды возникнут?"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ucmg9yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ucmg9yt","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Заполните эти пункты, и вы уже находитесь на пути к новому миру."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-h7i6jih","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-h7i6jih","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-mzn78d6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-mzn78d6","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Главное:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Не бойтесь «выходить за границы». Самый сильный импульс в творчестве часто рождается в моменте, когда вы позволяете себе задать нелепый, абсурдный или фантастический вопрос. Именно в этом кроет потенциал рождение оригинального концепта."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-3ejn977","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-3ejn977","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Если хотите, дайте мне знать, какая тема вам особенно близка, и я помогу развить её дальше! 🚀Вот несколько вариантов ментального прорыва («мозгового штурма») с разными акцентами — выберите тот, который подходит вам сейчас. Если ни один из них не подходит, бросайте свой вариант, и я помогу «разжечь» идею."}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-cyjkqkw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-cyjkqkw","updated":"20260113012640"}},{"ID":"20260113012640-87jsksb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-87jsksb","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. «Контрастный вопрос»"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-ow5umko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ow5umko","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Что, если всё, что казалось невозможным, уже изменилось, а вы даже не заметили?"}]},{"ID":"20260113012640-avilp6n","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-avilp6n","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-ev7d8u7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-ev7d8u7","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012640-n4k2y83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012640-n4k2y83","updated":"20260113012640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Какие технологии или практики прошлого