{"id":"20260113012804-mpkfqh1","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Эти принципы позволяют "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"прогнозировать"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" движение любой точки или твёрдого тела вблизи Земли и в космосе, а также формируют основу для более сложных разделов физики (вращательное движение, упругость, гидродинамика и т.д.)."}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-3th1b9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-3th1b9l","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Если нужны примеры расчётов или решения конкретных задач, дайте условие – помогу решить!"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Закон Ньютона"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-1xd3w12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-1xd3w12","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Закон движения тел, сформулированный Исааком Ньютоном в 1687 году в работе «Математические начала натуральной философии», состоит из трёх простых, но фундаментальных принципов."}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-8fshdy2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-8fshdy2","updated":"20260113012804"}},{"ID":"20260113012804-lfuceyu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-lfuceyu","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1️⃣ Первый закон (принцип инерции)"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-pm3h3ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-pm3h3ms","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Стат Observательный:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Если на тело не действуют внешние силы (или их результат равно нулю), оно остаётся в состоянии покоя или продолжает движение прямой равномерно»."}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-pnxxb2c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-pnxxb2c","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-5wjzdid","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-5wjzdid","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-4nlav8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-4nlav8l","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Что это значит:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-vl0ybxf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-vl0ybxf","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-uofdcqk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-uofdcqk","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-u39ek5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-u39ek5e","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Тело, находящееся в покое, будет оставаться покоивым, пока на него не приложит внешняя сила."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-ij3x6e0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-ij3x6e0","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-fh1es3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-fh1es3n","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Тело, движущееся равномерно и по прямой, будет сохранять эту кинематику, пока не будет под действием сил."}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-j9caf9y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-j9caf9y","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-nghq6vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-nghq6vt","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Практические примеры:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-3wom0nw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-3wom0nw","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-vebo7f5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-vebo7f5","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-eg6n7is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-eg6n7is","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Пассажир в лифте, который резко тормозит – тело «отталкивается» вперед, пока не будет остановлено ремнем."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-7gzlz1a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-7gzlz1a","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113012804-5558ib6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-5558ib6","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Стулья в метро, когда поезд ускоряется – пассажир ощущает «потянуло назад»."}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-47v65yr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-47v65yr","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2️⃣ Второй закон (принцип динамики)"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-1b2xmky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-1b2xmky","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Формула:"}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-safahe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-safahe0","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"["}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n\\mathbf{F}=m\\mathbf{a}\n"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"]"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113012804-u4n2tj5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113012804-u4n2tj5","updated":"20260113012804"},"Children